    "freezes"
   ],
   "start": 12.045,
   "end": 13.83,
   "show": 12.005,
   "hide": 14.16
  },
  {
   "text": "It can survive like this for weeks!",
   "emph": [
    "weeks"
   ],
   "start": 14.2,
   "end": 16.02,
   "show": 14.16,
   "hide": 16.39
  },
  {
   "text": "And when spring arrives,",
